{"id":19585,"artist":"Castle On a Cloud.  Kar by Bunty Pritchard Jones","title":"Les Miserables","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:05.54] (Young Cosette) There is a castle on a cloud,\n[00:10.15] I like to go there in my sleep,\n[00:14.77] Aren't any floors for me to sweep,\n[00:19.38] Not in my castle on a cloud.\n[00:24.00] There is a room that's full of toys,\n[00:28.62] There are a hundred girls and boys,\n[00:33.23] Nobody shouts or talks too loud,\n[00:37.85] Not in my castle on a cloud.\n[00:42.46] There is a lady all in white,\n[00:46.15] Holds me and sings a lullaby,\n[00:49.38] She's nice to see and she's soft to touch,\n[00:53.08] She says \"Cosette, I love you very much.\"\n[00:57.23] I know a place where no one's lost,\n[01:01.85] I know a place where no one cries,\n[01:06.46] Crying at all is not allowed,\n[01:11.08] Not in my castle on a cloud.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:05.53] <00:05.53>(Young Cosette) There <00:06.00>is <00:06.23>a <00:06.46>cas <00:06.92>tle <00:07.38>on <00:07.84>a <00:08.30>cloud,\n[00:10.15] <00:10.15>I <00:10.61>like <00:10.84>to <00:11.07>go <00:11.53>there <00:12.00>in <00:12.46>my <00:12.92>sleep,\n[00:14.76] <00:14.76>Aren't <00:15.23>a <00:15.46>ny <00:15.69>floors <00:16.15>for <00:16.61>me <00:17.07>to <00:17.53>sweep,\n[00:19.38] <00:19.38>Not <00:19.84>in <00:20.07>my <00:20.30>cas <00:20.76>tle <00:21.23>on <00:21.69>a <00:22.15>cloud.\n[00:24.00] <00:24.00>There <00:24.46>is <00:24.69>a <00:24.92>room <00:25.38>that's <00:25.84>full <00:26.30>of <00:26.76>toys,\n[00:28.61] <00:28.61>There <00:29.07>are <00:29.30>a <00:29.53>hun <00:30.00>dred <00:30.46>girls <00:30.92>and <00:31.38>boys,\n[00:33.23] <00:33.23>No <00:33.69>bod <00:33.92>y <00:34.15>shouts <00:34.61>or <00:35.07>talks <00:35.53>too <00:36.00>loud,\n[00:37.84] <00:37.84>Not <00:38.30>in <00:38.53>my <00:38.76>cas <00:39.23>tle <00:39.69>on <00:40.15>a <00:40.61>cloud.\n[00:42.46] <00:42.46>There <00:42.92>is <00:43.15>a <00:43.38>la <00:43.